        "TileImage": "$($repository 9f06a273-c273-439d-84ff-e55154bc7fb4).Image",
        "Description": "A local bank has asked us to test their security. Infiltrate the bank and see if you can perform the task without being caught.\r\rThe bank treats security very seriously. So much so that they&apos;ve even disguised the entire establishment to appear like a Cuban airfield hanger, and made their employees dress in military uniforms. Weird, but we don&apos;t judge these things.\r\rYou must exit using the designated exfiltration point. All other exits are forbidden.",
